  m_text: "A fast-striking melee skeleton that engages slymes up close.\nWhile its
    damage is modest, its quick attacks allow it to reliably finish off weakened
    enemies.\nIt\u2019s especially useful as a last line of defense when slymes slip
    past ranged towers.\nBest positioned near exits or tight defensive holds."
