  m_text: 'A slow but devastating melee skeleton that delivers crushing blows.

    Each
    strike deals massive damage, making it effective against tough and high-health
    slymes.

    Its slower attack speed means it benefits greatly from support and
    slowing effects.

    Use it to stop dangerous enemies that would otherwise overwhelm
    your defenses.'
