  m_text: "A dependable ranged skeleton that locks onto a single slyme at a time.\nWith
    balanced range, damage, and fire rate, the Skeleton Archer is a strong foundation
    for any defense.\nIt excels at thinning out early waves and supporting stronger
    towers later on.\nA great all-purpose choice when you\u2019re unsure what to
    build."
