  m_text: 'A non-combat skeleton focused entirely on boosting your economy.

    Instead
    of attacking slymes, it generates additional resources over time.

    While
    it offers no direct defense, the long-term benefits can greatly strengthen your
    strategy.

    Ideal for players planning ahead and building a powerful late-game
    defense.'
