  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A long-range skeleton armed with a powerful crossbow.

    Its precise
    shots allow it to strike slymes from extreme distances with deadly accuracy.

    While
    it fires more slowly and costs more than basic towers, each bolt deals heavy
    damage to priority targets.

    Best placed where it can maintain a clear line
    of sight across long paths.'
