  m_text: 'A crowd-control skeleton designed to slow groups of slymes.

    It fires
    multi-target burst projectiles that reduce movement speed rather than dealing
    heavy damage.

    This gives other skeletons more time to attack, making it
    invaluable in dense waves.

    Works best when paired with high-damage towers
    that benefit from extended firing time.'
