  m_text: 'A close-range skeleton that unleashes bursts of continuous flame.

    Its
    attacks hit multiple slymes at once, making it deadly at chokepoints and tight
    corners.

    Despite its limited range, the Flamethrower excels at clearing
    clustered enemies.

    Careful placement is key to getting the most out of this
    tower.'
